' UC-OSO-01 — Review Operational & Security Information

@startuml
skinparam conditionStyle inside
skinparam ActivityDiamondBackgroundColor #FFEAA7
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #DFE6E9

|WAH Central Administrator|
start
:1.0 Access operational & security oversight function;

|WAHrden System|
:1.1 Verify administrator review authority;
if (Authorized?) then (No [EF-01])
  :Present access-denied result;
  kill
else (Yes)
  :1.2 Present available information categories/views;
endif

|WAH Central Administrator|
:2.0 Select information category or view;

|WAHrden System|
:2.1 Retrieve data for category within authorized scope;
if (Data available?) then (No [EF-02])
  :Present no-applicable-information result;
  kill
elseif (Retrieval error?) then (Yes [EF-06])
  :Present retrieval failure;
  kill
else (Yes)
  :Present operational/security information;
endif

|WAH Central Administrator|
if (Apply search/filter criteria?) then (Yes [3.0])
  :Provide search/filter criteria;
  |WAHrden System|
  :3.1 Validate and apply criteria;
  if (Criteria valid?) then (No [EF-03])
    :Present criteria validation issue;
    kill
  elseif (Any matching records?) then (No [EF-04])
    :Present no-match result;
    kill
  else (Yes)
    :Present filtered records;
  endif
else (No)
endif

|WAH Central Administrator|
if (Inspect item details?) then (Yes [3.2])
  :Select specific record/event;
  |WAHrden System|
  :3.3 Retrieve item details;
  if (Item available?) then (No [EF-05])
    :Present item-unavailable error;
    kill
  else (Yes)
    :Present detailed information;
  endif
else (No)
endif

|WAH Central Administrator|
:4.0 Complete oversight review;

|WAHrden System|
|Database / Audit|
:4.1 Record oversight review activity & context;

|WAH Central Administrator|
stop
@enduml
